    "master": "rivet-run-highline-01",
    "invariant": "authored traversal geometry stays fixed for every seed; the SeedLayer only varies decoration, skyline, rooftop plant, container-yard colours, lighting and non-critical alternatives"
  },
  "theme": "late-afternoon working harbour: connected roof structures, a conveyor gallery, a relay yard, a turbine hall, a container terminal, a ship-to-shore crane and a moored feeder ship. No cyan void, floating islands, fantasy portal rings or exposed falls.",
  "how_to_pass": [
    "SECTOR 1 ROOFS — leave dispatch, jump the parapet gap, take the KINETIC PERMIT (double jump) in the transfer kiosk.",
    "SECTOR 2 GALLERY — ride the conveyor / slide the ducts up the gallery to the split deck; choose WEST SHAFT (wall kicks) or EAST SPAN (dash + container mantles) up to the boiler roof.",
    "SECTOR 3 RELAY YARD — pulse all THREE RELAYS (stack platform, rack platform, switchgear). GATE: the turbine-hall loading door is locked until they are live.",
    "SECTOR 4 DESCENT — slide the control corridor, drop the shaft, ride the crane trolley across the turbine hall, climb to the gallery, pass the loading door, cross the Sunline gantry (missing panel: double jump/dash) to the crane cab landing.",
    "SECTOR 5 TERMINAL — stair tower down to the 5-high stacks, run/drop the outbound row, slide the reefer gantry, drop into the CANYON, take the CRANE KEY CARD at its end, wall-kick chain out, mantle to the return row, run east to the field stair.",
    "SECTOR 6 CRANE — crane catwalk → spreader platform; GATE: the controller arms the spreader only for a key-card holder. Board the spreader and ride it over the quay.",
    "SECTOR 7 MV SUNLINE — step off onto bay 3, mantle the lashing bridges, hop the deck cargo aft, take the aft bridge stair to the main deck, climb the five accommodation flights, walk the bridge deck to the PORT WING. FINISH requires: 3 relays live + key card."
  ],
